<p>Lyrics</p>

<p>Haay .. Ae Rone Walo Hai Yeh Riwayat Me Likha.<br> Jis Dam Qayam Koofe Me Mukhtar Ne Kiya.<br>
Jo Bhi The Qatilane Shaheedane Karbala (A.s.),<br> Are Unme Se Koi Jab Bhi Gireftar Hota Tha.<br>
Hukme Ameer Par Wo Sitam Jab Sunata Tha <br>Mukhtar Sar Ko Peetke Bus Rota Jaata Tha.</p>

<p>Haay.. Ek Roz Tha Ye Koofe Ke Darbaar Ka Sama,<br> Ibne Numair (L.a.) Apne Sitam Karta Tha Bayaa.<br>
Todi Thi Maine Sinae Akbar (A.s.) Me Khud Sina,<br> Uthta Tha Shor Khaimo Se Maara Gaya Jawaa.<br>
Maa Jiteji Guzar Gai, Zainab (S.a.) Bhi Margai<br> Ek Barchi Mere Kitne Jigar Paar Kargai.</p>

<p>Haay.. Ek Roz Karke Laaya Gaya Hurmala (L.a.) Aseer,<br> Bola Wo Ran Me Maine Chalaye The Teen Teer <br>
Us Waqt Pehla Teer Chalaya Tha Ae Ameer,<br> Bhar Kar Chala Jo Mashk Toh Mazloom Ka Safeer (A.s.) <br>
Mashkeeze Se Jo Teer Mera Paar Hogaya <br>Aisa Laga Ke Qatl Alamdar (A.s.) Hogaya.</p>

<p>Haay.. Bola Laee Ye Karb Ka Hai Dusra Maqaam, <br>
Laaye Jo Apni God Me Besheer (A.s.) Ko Imaam (A.s.),<br> Sukhi Zaba Phirata Tha Hoto Pe Tishnakaam <br>
Yu Qat'a Ibne Zahra (A.s.) Ka Maine Kiya Kalam<br> Hil Hil Gaya Lahad Me Jigar Buturab (A.s.) Ka ,<br>Are Maqtal Me Neher Hogaya Bacha Rabab (S.a.) Ka</p>

<p>Haay.. Darbar Me Ye Sunke Qayamat Ka Tha Samaa<br> Are Peero Jawaan Rote The Lele Ke Hichkiya <br>
Bola Ye Hurmula (L.a.) Abhi Baaqi Hai Dastaa<br> Jis Dam Tera Husain (A.s.) Tha Teero Ke Darmiyaa <br>
Wo Teer Aakhri Tha Jo Maine Chalaya Tha <br>Arey Us Teer Ne Husain (A.s.) Ko Zee Se Giraya Tha</p>

<p>Haay.. Phir Shor Wa Husaina (A.s.) Ka Uthta Tha Baar Baar<br> Jab Qaid Karke Laya Gaya Shimre(L.a.)Bad Sheyaar <br>
Bola Wo Mere Haath Me Khanjar Tha Tez Dhaar <br>Jisse Kiye Husain (A.s.) Ki Gardan Pe Tera(13) Waar <br>
Khanjar Rawa Tha Halq Pe Ibne Batool (A.s.) Ke<br> Dil Kat Rahe The Saath Me Aale Rasool (A.s.)Ke.</p>

<p>Haay.. Ab Iske Baad Meer Takallum Baya Ho Kya <br>Ae Pursadaro Sochna Dil Me Kabhi Zara<br> Kyu Itna Waqt Qatile Shabbir Ko Laga <br>
Kis Waste Husain (A.s.) Ka Katta Na Tha Gala <br>
Mehsher Me Ye Khulega Sitam Kaynaat Par <br>Khanjar Ke Kuch Nishaan Hai Zahra (S.a.) Ke Haath Par<br>
</p>